{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12680","headline":"与党评事 · 元结","name":"与党评事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自顾无功劳，一岁官再迁。\n局身班次中，常窃媿耻焉。\n加以久荒浪，惛愚性颇全。\n未知在冠冕，不合无拘牵。\n勤强所不及，於人或未然。\n岂忘惠君子，恕之识见偏。\n且欲因我心，顺爲理化先。\n彼云万物情，有愿随所便。\n爱君得自遂，令我空渊禅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12680.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12680","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}